NameBlamTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\bitmaps\stanchion2_zbump.bitmap objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\bitmaps\stanchion_zbump

PortTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\shaders\stanchion_composite.shader
PortTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\shaders\stanchion_bipod.shader
PortTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\shaders\stanchion_magazine.shader
PortTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\shaders\stanchion_scanlines.shader
PortTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\shaders\stanchion_scope_glass.shader
PortTag objects\weapons\support_high\stanchion\shaders\stanchion_scope_glass_opaque.shader
